# BUDE .T FootWears — Landing Page Build

Let me walk you through this step by step. I'll first explain the design decisions, then deliver the complete code, and finally ask a few guiding questions so we can refine it together.

---

## 🎨 Design Strategy (Before We Code)

**Color Psychology:**
- **Black** → authority, premium feel
- **Gold** → luxury, trust, elegance
- **Brown** → earthiness, leather, craftsmanship
- **White** → breathing room, cleanliness

**Typography Pairing:**
- **Playfair Display** (serif) for headlines — timeless, editorial, premium
- **Inter** (sans-serif) for body — clean, highly readable, modern

**Key UX Decisions:**
1. Sticky header with search + cart icon (e-commerce-ready)
2. Mobile-first grid that scales up to 4 columns on desktop
3. Intersection Observer for scroll-reveal animations (lightweight, no library)
4. WhatsApp CTA with pre-filled message (easy order conversion)
5. Placeholder product images from Unsplash (swap with real photos later)

---

## 📄 Complete Code — `index.html`

Save this as a single file and open it in your browser. Everything is self-contained.

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <meta name="description" content="BUDE .T FootWears — Premium quality shoes and accessories for men, women, and kids. Step into quality, walk with confidence." />
  <meta name="keywords" content="shoes, footwear, men shoes, women shoes, kids shoes, boots, sandals, accessories, Nigeria" />
  <meta name="author" content="BUDE .T FootWears" />
  <title>BUDE .T FootWears — Step Into Quality. Walk With Confidence.</title>

  <!-- Fonts -->
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:wght@500;600;700;800&family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />

  <!-- Font Awesome for icons -->
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css" />

  <style>
    /* ---------- RESET & BASE ---------- */
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; }
    body {
      font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
      color: #1a1a1a;
      background: #fff;
      line-height: 1.6;
      overflow-x: hidden;
    }
    img { max-width: 100%; display: block; }
    a { text-decoration: none; color: inherit; }
    button { font-family: inherit; cursor: pointer; border: none; background: none; }

    :root {
      --black: #0a0a0a;
      --white: #ffffff;
      --off-white: #faf8f5;
      --brown: #6b4423;
      --brown-light: #8b5a2b;
      --gold: #c9a961;
      --gold-dark: #a8893f;
      --gray: #6b6b6b;
      --light-gray: #e8e4df;
      --shadow-sm: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
      --shadow-md: 0 6px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
      --shadow-lg: 0 12px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.12);
      --radius: 14px;
      --transition: 0.35s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
    }

    h1, h2, h3, h4 { font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.2; color: var(--black); }

    .container { width: 100%; max-width: 1240px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 20px; }

    .section { padding: 80px 0; }
    .section-title {
      text-align: center;
      font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.6rem);
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }
    .section-subtitle {
      text-align: center;
      color: var(--gray);
      font-size: 1rem;
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 0 auto 50px;
    }
    .gold-line {
      width: 60px; height: 3px;
      background: var(--gold);
      margin: 16px auto 20px;
      border-radius: 2px;
    }

    /* ---------- BUTTONS ---------- */
    .btn {
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      gap: 8px;
      padding: 14px 30px;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.3px;
      border-radius: 50px;
      transition: var(--transition);
      white-space: nowrap;
    }
    .btn-primary { background: var(--gold); color: var(--black); }
    .btn-primary:hover { background: var(--gold-dark); transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: var(--shadow-md); }
    .btn-outline { border: 2px solid var(--white); color: var(--white); background: transparent; }
    .btn-outline:hover { background: var(--white); color: var(--black); }
    .btn-dark { background: var(--black); color: var(--white); }
    .btn-dark:hover { background: var(--brown); transform: translateY(-2px); }

    /* ---------- HEADER ---------- */
    .header {
      position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.97);
      backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
      z-index: 1000;
      transition: var(--transition);
      border-bottom: 1px solid transparent;
    }
    .header.scrolled { box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm); border-bottom-color: var(--light-gray); }
    .nav {
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 16px 0;
      gap: 20px;
    }
    .logo {
      font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
      font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 800;
      color: var(--black);
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    }
    .logo span { color: var(--gold); }
    .nav-links { display: flex; gap: 32px; list-style: none; }
    .nav-links a {
      font-size: 0.92rem; font-weight: 500;
      color: var(--black);
      position: relative;
      transition: var(--transition);
    }
    .nav-links a::after {
      content: ''; position: absolute; bottom: -6px; left: 0;
      width: 0; height: 2px; background: var(--gold);
      transition: var(--transition);
    }
    .nav-links a:hover { color: var(--gold); }
    .nav-links a:hover::after { width: 100%; }

    .nav-icons { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 18px; }
    .nav-icons button {
      font-size: 1.1rem; color: var(--black);
      position: relative;
      transition: var(--transition);
    }
    .nav-icons button:hover { color: var(--gold); }
    .cart-count {
      position: absolute; top: -8px; right: -10px;
      background: var(--gold); color: var(--black);
      font-size: 0.65rem; font-weight: 700;
      width: 18px; height: 18px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    }

    .search-bar {
      display: none;
      align-items: center;
      background: var(--off-white);
      border-radius: 50px;
      padding: 8px 16px;
      gap: 8px;
    }
    .search-bar input {
      border: none; background: transparent;
      outline: none; font-size: 0.9rem;
      width: 180px;
    }
    .search-bar i { color: var(--gray); }

    .menu-toggle { display: none; font-size: 1.4rem; }

    /* ---------- HERO ---------- */
    .hero {
      position: relative;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex; align-items: center;
      background:
        linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(10,10,10,0.75) 0%, rgba(107,68,35,0.55) 100%),
        url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1460353581641-37baddab0fa2?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1920&q=80') center/cover no-repeat;
      color: var(--white);
      padding: 120px 0 80px;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .hero::after {
      content: ''; position: absolute; bottom: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
      height: 80px;
      background: linear-gradient(to bottom, transparent, var(--white));
    }
    .hero-content { max-width: 720px; position: relative; z-index: 2; }
    .hero-tag {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 6px 16px;
      background: rgba(201,169,97,0.2);
      border: 1px solid var(--gold);
      border-radius: 50px;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--gold);
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }
    .hero h1 {
      color: var(--white);
      font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 5.5vw, 4.2rem);
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    .hero h1 em {
      font-style: italic;
      color: var(--gold);
    }
    .hero p {
      font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.6vw, 1.15rem);
      margin-bottom: 36px;
      opacity: 0.92;
      max-width: 560px;
    }
    .hero-buttons { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 14px; }

    /* ---------- CATEGORIES ---------- */
    .categories-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
      gap: 20px;
    }
    .category-card {
      position: relative;
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      overflow: hidden;
      aspect-ratio: 4/5;
      cursor: pointer;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
      transition: var(--transition);
    }
    .category-card:hover { transform: translateY(-6px); box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg); }
    .category-card img {
      width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover;
      transition: transform 0.6s ease;
    }
    .category-card:hover img { transform: scale(1.08); }
    .category-card::before {
      content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 0;
      background: linear-gradient(to top, rgba(10,10,10,0.85) 0%, rgba(10,10,10,0.1) 55%);
      z-index: 1;
    }
    .category-card-content {
      position: absolute; bottom: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
      padding: 24px;
      z-index: 2;
      color: var(--white);
    }
    .category-card h3 {
      color: var(--white);
      font-size: 1.3rem;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }
    .category-card span {
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: var(--gold);
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;
      transition: var(--transition);
    }
    .category-card:hover span { gap: 12px; }

    /* ---------- COLLECTIONS (Men/Women/Kids) ---------- */
    .collection { background: var(--off-white); }
    .collection:nth-of-type(even) { background: var(--white); }
    .collection-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(180px, 1fr));
      gap: 18px;
    }
    .collection-card {
      background: var(--white);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      overflow: hidden;
      text-align: center;
      transition: var(--transition);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
      cursor: pointer;
    }
    .collection:nth-of-type(even) .collection-card { background: var(--off-white); }
    .collection-card:hover { transform: translateY(-5px); box-shadow: var(--shadow-md); }
    .collection-card-img {
      aspect-ratio: 1;
      overflow: hidden;
      background: var(--light-gray);
    }
    .collection-card-img img {
      width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover;
      transition: transform 0.5s ease;
    }
    .collection-card:hover img { transform: scale(1.06); }
    .collection-card-body { padding: 18px 12px; }
    .collection-card h4 {
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }
    .collection-card p { font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--gray); }

    /* ---------- FEATURED PRODUCTS ---------- */
    .products-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));
      gap: 24px;
    }
    .product-card {
      background: var(--white);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
      transition: var(--transition);
      position: relative;
    }
    .product-card:hover { transform: translateY(-6px); box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg); }
    .product-badge {
      position: absolute; top: 14px; left: 14px;
      padding: 4px 12px;
      font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 700;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
      border-radius: 50px;
      z-index: 2;
    }
    .badge-sale { background: #c0392b; color: var(--white); }
    .badge-new { background: var(--gold); color: var(--black); }
    .product-img {
      aspect-ratio: 1;
      overflow: hidden;
      background: var(--off-white);
    }
    .product-img img {
      width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover;
      transition: transform 0.5s ease;
    }
    .product-card:hover .product-img img { transform: scale(1.05); }
    .product-body { padding: 20px; }
    .product-body h4 {
      font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
      font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 600;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }
    .product-desc { font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--gray); margin-bottom: 12px; }
    .product-price {
      display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    .price-current { font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--brown); }
    .price-old { font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--gray); text-decoration: line-through; }
    .product-actions { display: flex; gap: 8px; }
    .product-actions button {
      flex: 1;
      padding: 10px;
      font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 600;
      border-radius: 8px;
      transition: var(--transition);
    }
    .btn-cart { background: var(--off-white); color: var(--black); }
    .btn-cart:hover { background: var(--light-gray); }
    .btn-buy { background: var(--black); color: var(--white); }
    .btn-buy:hover { background: var(--brown); }

    /* ---------- WHY CHOOSE US ---------- */
    .why-us {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--black) 0%, #2a1a0f 100%);
      color: var(--white);
    }
    .why-us .section-title, .why-us h3 { color: var(--white); }
    .why-us .section-subtitle { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7); }
    .features-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));
      gap: 24px;
    }
    .feature-card {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 32px 20px;
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
      border: 1px solid rgba(201,169,97,0.15);
      transition: var(--transition);
    }
    .feature-card:hover {
      background: rgba(201,169,97,0.08);
      border-color: var(--gold);
      transform: translateY(-4px);
    }
    .feature-icon {
      width: 64px; height: 64px;
      margin: 0 auto 18px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--gold), var(--gold-dark));
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      font-size: 1.5rem; color: var(--black);
    }
    .feature-card h3 { font-size: 1.15rem; margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .feature-card p { font-size: 0.9rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7); }

    /* ---------- TESTIMONIALS ---------- */
    .testimonials-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
      gap: 24px;
    }
    .testimonial-card {
      background: var(--white);
      padding: 30px;
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
      border: 1px solid var(--light-gray);
      transition: var(--transition);
      position: relative;
    }
    .testimonial-card:hover { box-shadow: var(--shadow-md); transform: translateY(-3px); }
    .testimonial-card::before {
      content: '\201C';
      position: absolute; top: 10px; right: 20px;
      font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
      font-size: 4rem;
      color: var(--gold);
      opacity: 0.3;
      line-height: 1;
    }
    .stars { color: var(--gold); margin-bottom: 14px; font-size: 0.95rem; }
    .testimonial-text { font-size: 0.95rem; color: #333; margin-bottom: 20px; font-style: italic; }
    .testimonial-author { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; }
    .author-avatar {
      width: 48px; height: 48px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--gold), var(--brown));
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      color: var(--white); font-weight: 700;
    }
    .author-info h5 { font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 2px; }
    .author-info span { font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--gray); }

    /* ---------- CTA BANNER ---------- */
    .cta-banner {
      background:
        linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(10,10,10,0.85), rgba(107,68,35,0.75)),
        url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1549298916-b41d501d3772?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1920&q=80') center/cover;
      color: var(--white);
      text-align: center;
      padding: 90px 20px;
    }
    .cta-banner h2 {
      color: var(--white);
      font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.8rem);
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    .cta-banner p { max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto 32px; opacity: 0.92; }
    .cta-buttons { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; gap: 14px; }
    .btn-whatsapp { background: #25D366; color: var(--white); }
    .btn-whatsapp:hover { background: #1ebe57; transform: translateY(-2px); }

    /* ---------- FOOTER ---------- */
    .footer {
      background: var(--black);
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.75);
      padding: 70px 0 20px;
    }
    .footer-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.5fr 1fr 1fr 1.2fr;
      gap: 40px;
      margin-bottom: 50px;
    }
    .footer h4 {
      color: var(--white);
      font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
      font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 600;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    }
    .footer-brand p { font-size: 0.9rem; margin: 14px 0 20px; line-height: 1.7; }
    .footer-brand .logo { font-size: 1.6rem; }
    .social-icons { display: flex; gap: 12px; }
    .social-icons a {
      width: 40px; height: 40px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      color: var(--white);
      transition: var(--transition);
    }
    .social-icons a:hover { background: var(--gold); color: var(--black); transform: translateY(-3px); }
    .footer ul { list-style: none; }
    .footer ul li { margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: 0.9rem; }
    .footer ul a { transition: var(--transition); }
    .footer ul a:hover { color: var(--gold); padding-left: 4px; }
    .contact-item { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 12px; font-size: 0.9rem; }
    .contact-item i { color: var(--gold); margin-top: 4px; }
    .footer-bottom {
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
      padding-top: 20px;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
    }
    .footer-bottom span { color: var(--gold); }

    /* ---------- SCROLL REVEAL ---------- */
    .reveal {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(30px);
      transition: opacity 0.8s ease, transform 0.8s ease;
    }
    .reveal.visible { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }

    /* ---------- RESPONSIVE ---------- */
    @media (min-width: 768px) {
      .search-bar { display: flex; }
    }
    @media (max-width: 900px) {
      .footer-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
    }
    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .section { padding: 60px 0; }
      .nav-links {
        position: fixed;
        top: 70px; left: 0; right: 0;
        background: var(--white);
        flex-direction: column;
        padding: 30px 20px;
        gap: 20px;
        box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
        transform: translateY(-120%);
        transition: var(--transition);
      }
      .nav-links.open { transform: translateY(0); }
      .menu-toggle { display: block; }
      .hero { min-height: 90vh; padding-top: 100px; }
      .hero-buttons { flex-direction: column; width: 100%; }
      .hero-buttons .btn { width: 100%; }
      .footer-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 30px; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <!-- ============ HEADER ============ -->
  <header class="header" id="header">
    <div class="container">
      <nav class="nav">
        <a href="#" class="logo">BUDE <span>.T</span> FootWears</a>

        <ul class="nav-links" id="navLinks">
          <li><a href="#home">Home</a></li>
          <li><a href="#categories">Shop</a></li>
          <li><a href="#men">Men</a></li>
          <li><a href="#women">Women</a></li>
          <li><a href="#kids">Kids</a></li>
          <li><a href="#contact">Contact</a></li>
        </ul>

        <div class="nav-icons">
          <div class="search-bar">
            <i class="fas fa-search"></i>
            <input type="text" placeholder="Search footwear..." />
          </div>
          <button aria-label="Wishlist"><i class="far fa-heart"></i></button>
          <button aria-label="Cart" style="position:relative;">
            <i class="fas fa-shopping-bag"></i>
            <span class="cart-count">0</span>
          </button>
          <button class="menu-toggle" id="menuToggle" aria-label="Menu"><i class="fas fa-bars"></i></button>
        </div>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- ============ HERO ============ -->
  <section class="hero" id="home">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="hero-content">
        <span class="hero-tag">Premium Footwear Since Day One</span>
        <h1>Step Into <em>Quality.</em><br/>Walk With <em>Confidence.</em></h1>
        <p>Discover handpicked shoes and accessories for men, women, and kids. Crafted for comfort, built to last, priced to fit your lifestyle — only at BUDE .T FootWears.</p>
        <div class="hero-buttons">
          <a href="#products" class="btn btn-primary">Shop Now <i class="fas fa-arrow-right"></i></a>
          <a href="#categories" class="btn btn-outline">View Collection</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ CATEGORIES ============ -->
  <section class="section" id="categories">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 class="section-title reveal">Shop By Category</h2>
      <div class="gold-line reveal"></div>
      <p class="section-subtitle reveal">Explore our curated collections — something perfect for every step of your journey.</p>

      <div class="categories-grid">
        <a href="#men" class="category-card reveal">
          <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1614252369475-531eba835eb1?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80" alt="Men's Shoes" />
          <div class="category-card-content">
            <h3>Men's Shoes</h3>
            <span>Shop Now <i class="fas fa-arrow-right"></i></span>
          </div>
        </a>
        <a href="#women" class="category-card reveal">
          <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1543163521-1bf539c55dd2?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80" alt="Women's Shoes" />
          <div class="category-card-content">
            <h3>Women's Shoes</h3>
            <span>Shop Now <i class="fas fa-arrow-right"></i></span>
          </div>
