# Yes, Absolutely! Alhamdulillah! 🎉

Embedding a Google Form is **100% doable and advisable** for your use case. It's free, reliable, and requires zero backend. Perfect for a landing page!

---

## ✅ Why It's a Good Idea

- **Free forever** — No hosting costs
- **Auto-saves to Google Sheets** — Easy to track leads
- **No backend needed** — Pure frontend solution
- **Mobile responsive** — Works on all devices
- **Spam protection** — Google handles it
- **Email notifications** — Get alerts for new submissions

---

## Step-by-Step Guide

### Step 1: Create Your Google Form

1. Go to [forms.google.com](https://forms.google.com)
2. Click **"Blank form"**
3. Add these fields:

**Form Title:** `Contact BUDE .T FootWears`  
**Form Description:** `Fill out the form below and we'll get back to you within 24 hours.`

**Fields to Add:**
1. **Full Name** (Short answer) — *Required*
2. **Phone Number** (Short answer) — *Required*
3. **Email Address** (Short answer) — *Required*
4. **I'm interested in** (Dropdown) — *Required*
   - Men's Shoes
   - Women's Shoes
   - Kids' Shoes
   - Accessories
   - General Inquiry
5. **Your Message** (Paragraph) — *Optional*
6. **Preferred Contact Method** (Multiple choice)
   - Phone Call
   - WhatsApp
   - Email

**Settings:**
- Click the gear icon ⚙️
- Under "Responses": ✅ Collect email addresses
- Under "Presentation": Show link to submit another response ❌

---

### Step 2: Get the Embed Code

1. Click **"Send"** button (top right)
2. Click the **`< >` Embed** icon
3. Copy the iframe code
4. Adjust width to `100%` and height to `600`

Example:
```html
<iframe src="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/YOUR_FORM_ID/viewform?embedded=true" 
        width="100%" 
        height="600" 
        frameborder="0" 
        marginheight="0" 
        marginwidth="0">
  Loading…
</iframe>
```

---

### Step 3: Add to `index.html`

**Paste this section** between the CTA banner and footer:

```html
<!-- ============ CONTACT FORM SECTION ============ -->
<section class="section contact-form-section" id="contactForm">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-title reveal">Get In Touch</h2>
    <div class="gold-line reveal"></div>
    <p class="section-subtitle reveal">Have questions? Want to place a custom order? Fill out the form below and we'll respond within 24 hours.</p>

    <div class="form-container reveal">
      <iframe 
        src="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/YOUR_FORM_ID_HERE/viewform?embedded=true" 
        width="100%" 
        height="650" 
        frameborder="0" 
        marginheight="0" 
        marginwidth="0"
        title="Contact Form"
        style="border-radius: 14px; box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg); background: var(--white);">
        Loading…
      </iframe>
    </div>

    <div class="form-alternatives reveal">
      <p>Prefer to reach out directly?</p>
      <div class="contact-options">
        <a href="https://wa.me/2348012345678" target="_blank" class="contact-option">
          <i class="fab fa-whatsapp"></i>
